{
  "slug": "saweetie-shoots-her-shot-at-fan-during-rolling-loud-miami-performance-watch",
  "postId": 74722,
  "title": "Saweetie Shoots Her Shot At Fan During Rolling Loud Miami Performance [Watch]",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":516911,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Saweetie-3-656x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-516911\"/><figcaption>Multi-Platinum-Selling Songwriter &amp; Rapper Saweetie Headlines Sprite's Live From The Label Virtual Concert Series Live From LA: Courtesy of Sprite</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>California native Saweetie was on the bill for the first day of Rolling Loud in Miami. During her performance, she used the opportunity to debut some singles from her debut album <a href=\"https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/saweetie-explains-pretty-b-tch-music-debut-delay-not-an-album-its-a-movement-news.154350.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Pretty Bitch Music</a>, which <a href=\"https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/saweetie-teases-new-music-from-upcoming-debut-album-at-rolling-loud-watch-news.155385.html\">according to Hot New Hip Hop</a>, was supposed to debut some time ago. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>She also played hits such as Mozzy \"In My Face,\" with also 2 Chainz and YG, along with Muni Long's catchy summer anthem, \"Baby Boo.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>She also entertained the crowd with her hits such as \"Best Friend,\" \"My Type,\" and \"Tap In.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Saweetie was also caught on camera stopping her show from shooting her shot to a fan, according to DJ Akademiks. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CgXL61xgXrW/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/reel/CgXL61xgXrW/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Of course, these festivals can not end without some controversy. Also, during Saweetie's set, she was giving an untitled song all she got, which fans on the internet started to point out that it sounded similar to another well-known song, “we not humping” by Monaleo and FloMilli.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/_tonyMC/status/1550624227199520768?s=20u0026t=sy72tqxka88reljnEGaaFg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/_tonyMC/status/1550624227199520768?s=20&amp;t=sy72tqxka88reljnEGaaFg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/_Rawilcox/status/1550907911953649665?s=20u0026t=-sSNmn4pLyeEY5JqUQ2c8w\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/_Rawilcox/status/1550907911953649665?s=20&amp;t=-sSNmn4pLyeEY5JqUQ2c8w\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/Dop3CU4CXm4\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/Dop3CU4CXm4\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You be the judge!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
